<title>UK: ANA sets 385 mln SFR 3-year equity warrant bond.</title>
<headline>ANA sets 385 mln SFR 3-year equity warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALL NIPPON AIRWAYS TD (ANA)</p>
<p> AMT    385 MLN SFR   COUPON     0.125     MATURITY    26.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE   STR/WW	  ISS PRICE  101.875   PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K)  50 (+50)</p>
<p> NOTES	REPACKAGED AS ANA WORLD WINGS LTD, WITH WARRANTS</p>
<p>		EXERCISABLE INTO SHARES OF ALL NIPPON AIRWAYS</p>
<p>		ONE TIME ADJUSTMENT AFTER ONE YEAR. SETTING DATE</p>
<p>		29.JUL.98, EFFECTIVE 11.AUG.98. 80 PCT FLOOR.</p>
<p>		STRIKE PRICE 744 YEN, FOREX FIX 77.92 YEN/SFR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
